          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Are Lab-Grown Diamonds Real?"
          }
        },
        "text_UVkei4": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Yes. Lab-grown diamonds are real diamonds. They are not simulants such as cubic zirconia or moissanite. Their composition and performance are identical to those of natural diamonds.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        },
        "subheading_6JPVnT": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Choosing Between Lab-Grown and Natural Diamonds"
          }
        },
        "text_ejqAVd": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Lab-grown diamonds are well suited for those seeking:</p><ul><li>Greater size or quality within a defined budget<br/></li><li>Ethical and transparent sourcing<br/></li><li>Contemporary, value-driven luxury<br/></li></ul><p>Natural diamonds may be preferred by those who value:</p><ul><li>Geological rarity<br/></li><li>Traditional significance<br/></li><li>Long-term perception and resale potentisl</li></ul>",
